        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Schlage F-Series Andover Door Knob Set</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nPerfect for traditional and more modern style homes, Schlage's Andover knob is constructed out of brass and is available in 8 beautiful finishes. It will fit door thicknesses from 1-3/8\" up to 1-3/4\" and has an adjustable backset for 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\". Available in single dummy, passage, privacy, keyed entry, and storeroom lock functions.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Schlage Andover Door Knob:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>One piece knob for better security and appearance.</li>\r\n<li>Fits standard pre-drilled doors.</li>\r\n<li>ANSI A156.2 Series 4000 Grade 2.</li>\r\n<li>Pressure-cast zinc tubular lock housing.</li>\r\n<li>Solid brass knob and trim rose.</li>\r\n<li>Sold as complete set.</li>\r\n<li>Easy to install.</li>\r\n<li><b>Lifetime mechanical warranty on residential applications.</b></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</B> of the F-Series Andover Schlage Door Knob:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Knob Diameter: 2-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 2-5/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Rose Diameter: 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Adjustable Backset for 2-3/8\" up to 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Adjustable for 1-3/8\" up to 1-3/4\" thick doors</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Function:</b> \r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Single Dummy:</b> For use as a pull or to match trim on one side of the door. It does not latch and does not lock.</li>\r\n<li><b>Passage (Hall or Closet):</b> For doors that don't need locking. Latches but does not lock.</li>\r\n<li><b>Privacy (Bedroom or Bathroom):</b> For doors that could need locking. The lock is activated by a push button in the center of the knob while turning the inside knob releases the lock. It can be opened from the outside with a small circular tool.</li>\r\n<li><b>Keyed Entry (Keyed Lock):</b> Use when a handle operated by a lock is needed. Unlocked by a key from the outside when locked by inside turn button.  Inside always unlocked. </li>\r\n<li><b>Storeroom Lock (Keyed Entry Only):</b> Use when entry by a key is needed. Always locked, entry from the outside requires a key. The inside knob is always unlocked. The outside knob is fixed.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Andover Door Knob, Schlage F-AND",
                "description": "Andover Half-Round Knob Schalge AND - Perfect for traditional and more modern style homes, Schlage's Andover knob is constructed out of brass and is available in 8 beautiful finishes. It will fit door thicknesses from 1-3/8 inches up to 1-3/4 inches and has an adjustable backset for 2-3/8 inches or 2-3/4 inches. Available in single dummy, passage, privacy, keyed entry, and storeroom lock functions.",
